7592186399475 1072 #uuid "38dbfb09-c609-5f82-9c41-6942da640f6a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399475 1074 "The expected value of a discrete random variable $X$ with probability mass function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}x\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nLet $X$ be the number on a randomly drawn card. Then the support is $S={4,7,10,…,31},$ and the corresponding probabilities are all $\\frac{1}{10}:$\n\n$$\nf(4)=f(7)=f(10)=…=f(31)=\\frac{1}{10}\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =4\\cdot f(4)+7\\cdot f(7)+10\\cdot f(10)+…+31\\cdot f(10) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{10}+\\frac{7}{10}+\\frac{10}{10}+…+\\frac{31}{10} \\\\  & =\\frac{4+7+10+13+16+19+22+25+28+31}{10} \\\\  & =\\frac{175}{10} \\\\  & =17.5\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399477 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399478 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399479 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399480 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399481 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399481 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1080 #uuid "976a52a5-b179-5232-a723-a916fc10fd46" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1081 "10" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1084 #uuid "ad10e4d0-b561-5be8-8912-0809155fcfd9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399478 1081 "15" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399478 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 131941