 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not in row echelon form since the second row contains only zeros and it is not at the bottom of the matrix (condition I is violated).\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $A$ and $B$ are in row echelon form." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399582 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399583 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399584 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399585 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399586 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399584 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1080 #uuid "66d750fb-7735-51a0-af69-3504b188c41c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399582 1081 "$A$ and $C$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399582 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399582 1084 #uuid "d2b3c396-ac33-5afb-9d7a-0df60551bdca" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399583 1081 "$A$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399583 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399583 1084 #uuid "c68e1376-7df0-532e-83e1-d3e4a686dfa9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399584 1081 "$A$ and $B$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399584 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399584 1084 #uuid