dde3e3e299c3" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399600 1081 "$A,$ $B,$ and $C$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399600 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399600 1084 #uuid "a355422c-4d74-55b5-a177-12f7fda4364c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399602 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1069 "q-129224" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1071 "The intersection of the planes $2x-y-3z-8=0$ and $x+2y-3z-4=0$ is given by the line\n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨{a}_{1},{a}_{2},0⟩+tb,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$\n\nCalculate ${a}_{1}+{a}_{2},$ and find a possible direction vector $b.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1072 #uuid "923148c0-0ecb-5f91-a025-b18771e50157" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399601 1074 "We're given that there exists a point on the line where $z=0.$ Substituting this to the first equation gives\n\n$$\n2x-y-3(0)-8=0\\,⟹\\,y=2x-8,\n$$\n\nand substituting $z=0$ and $y=2x-8$ into the second equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+2(2x-8)-0-4 & =0 \\\\ x+4x-16-4 & =0 \\\\ 5x & =20 \\\\ x & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $y=2(4)-8=0$ and $a=⟨4,0,0⟩$ is a position vector of a point on the line.\n\nNext, we notice:\n\n- For the plane $2x-y-3z-8=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨2,-1,-3⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $x+2y-3z-4=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨1,2,-3⟩.$\n\nTo find a direction vector for the line, we calculate the cross product of these normal vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2} & =⟨2,-1,-3⟩\\times ⟨1,2,-3⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =9i+3j+5k \\\\  & =⟨9,3,5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the equation of the line is:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =a+tb \\\\ r(t) & =⟨4,0,0⟩+t⟨9,3,5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally then, ${a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=4+0=4,$ and $b=⟨9,3,5⟩.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399603 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399604 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399605 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399606 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399607 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399605 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399602 1080 #uuid "17d7ccaf-18fd-5fe2-bf5c-7ec52555ab3d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=-4,\\,b=⟨9,5,3⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1084 #uuid "d6af159c-b46d-5f23-a72f-d37f7d8b6c4a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=8,\\,b=⟨5,3,9⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1084 #uuid "c3139276-08b4-56c9-b405-23041fd40cc8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=4,\\,b=⟨9,3,5⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1084 #uuid "880caa6a-847c-5b25-a64d-abcc3d2d9f08" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399606 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=2,\\,b=⟨3,9,5⟩" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399606 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399606 1084 #uuid "f699bd35-2839-5408-8f07-791a9775b7d8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399607 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=-2,\\,b=⟨6,3,5⟩" 1319413953347